  "description": "EasyTdd.Generators is a .NET source generator that simplifies test code by generating two types of helpers: builders and FluentMocks.\n\n\t\t\tBuilder generator creates strongly-typed builder classes for your domain types, supporting constructor parameters, property setters, and generic type arguments. Builders help construct objects in tests with minimal boilerplate.\n\n\t\t\tFluentMock generator wraps the Moq framework to generate fluent, strongly-typed Setup and Verify methods for each method and property of the target interface or class, making mocks easier to use and maintain.\n\n\t\t\tThe generator works independently and does not require additional tools.\n\t\t\tIt is also used by the EasyTdd Visual Studio extension and can work with templates and settings defined by the extension.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "EasyTdd.Generators",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-05T06:42:59.517Z",
