  "published": "2026-10-05T06:38:57.037Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.3\n- Corrected FluentMock generation for inherited and hidden members, including properties declared with new and namespace-qualified method types.\n- Corrected tuple type rendering in generated builder and FluentMock signatures.\n- Updated Scriban to 7.5.0 to address dependency security advisories.\n\n0.5.2\n- Added default settings when .easyTdd is absent.\n- Fixed builder and FluentMock generation for inherited members, hidden properties, and indexers.\n\n0.5.0.4\n- Excluded properties without public setters from builder generation.\n\n0.5.0.3\n- Prevented duplicate generation of overridden members in builders and tests.\n\n0.5.0.1\n- Maintained backward compatibility with version 0.4.0.5.\n\n0.5.0.0\n- Added the incremental FluentMock source generator.\n\n0.4.0.5\n- Fixed builder generation for same-named classes in different namespaces.\n\n0.4.0.3\n- Fixed template resolution when a template in the root .easyTdd directory shares a name with one in a subdirectory.\n\n0.4.0.0\n- Introduced the incremental builder source generator, with version numbering aligned to the EasyTdd Visual Studio extension.",
